https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1952 (short story by Charlotte Perkins Gilman)

# Goal:
Compare two stories from The Trimmed Lamp, and Other Stories of the Four Million by O. Henry to compare word usage between two works from the same author.
Compare Gilman's story with one by Henry to compare two stories by different authors.

# How to Achieve Goal:
I would first remove the license information and other unwanted pages from each book. Then I would use a method that calculates average word frequencies so that books with different lengths can be compared fairly. First, I will compare the two stories by Henry to identify differences in their word frequencies. Then, I will compare Gilman's story with a story by Henry to see if there are differences in their word usage.
